==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|retrōgressus|lang=la}}, perfect active participle of {{term|retrōgradior||retrograde|lang=la}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|retrogress|es}}

# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To [[return]] to an [[earlier]], [[simpler]] or [[worse]] [[condition]]; to [[regress]].
# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To go [[backwards]]; to [[retreat]].
# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To return to bad [[behaviour]]; to [[relapse]].

====Antonyms====
* [[progress#Verb|progress]]

